          <li>The same house from a builder is usually <strong>$56k&ndash;$112k</strong>; custom builds go higher.</li>
          <li>Tiny houses cost <strong>more per square foot</strong> than standard homes but far less in total.</li>
          <li>Land, utility hookups, permits and parking are the costs that sink budgets. Price them before you buy a plan.</li>
          <li>Plans are about 1% of a typical build. Good drawings save more than they cost.</li>
